"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Zvirambidzo zvesimba, kubatanidza kune imwe torrent, kurodha pasi uye kugovera zvinoiswa kune yega yega torrent paunenge uchiwedzera iyo, kana gare gare pasi peZvirongwa zveTorrent. Torrents inoshandisa proxy kubva kuConnection tab (HTTP kana SOCKS5, kana Mac's proxy ne \"Use the system settings\") uye zvirambidzo zvesimba kune ese madownloads. Zvigadziriso zvichashandiswa kune torrents dzakatanga mushure meizvozvo. Peers uye trackers vanogona kuona yako IP kero, kana yako proxy's.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Zvirongwa zvinoshandiswa pakurodha pasi kubva pawebhusaiti. Iyo saiti inosanganisirawo subdomains yayo (example.com inosanganisira www.example.com). Mazita ekushandisa anoendeswa chete kune iyo saiti uye anochengetwa pamwe nevamwe vasiri veapp.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Kuchengetera kunochengeta zvirongwa zvako, zvirongwa zvesaiti, zvikoro uye zvinyorwa zvekurodha pasi. Mapassword uye macookies haasi kuchengetwa mukuchengetedza.";
"When you copy a link that ends in one of these types, the Add window opens with it." = "Kana iwe ukanyora chinongedzo chinopera neimwe yemhando iyi, iyo Add window ichavhura ichi.";
"Expected checksums are checked automatically when a download finishes. Queues can also quit the app, sleep or shut down the Mac when they are done (Scheduler)." = "Zviri kutarisirwa checksums zvinoongororwa otomatiki paunenge kurodha pasi yapera. Queues anogonawo kubuda app, kumira kana kudzima Mac pava kuitwa (Scheduler).";
"Save the extension folder, open the browser's extensions page, switch on Developer mode, choose Load unpacked and pick the folder." = "Kuchengeta kuwedzera folder, avhure browser's kuwedzera peji, switch on Developer mode, sarudza Load unpacked uye sarudza folder.";
"Save the add-on file and drag it onto a Firefox window. Firefox installs add-ons that are signed; see the README for signing your copy." = "Kuchengeta add-on faira uye kudhonza pamusoro peFirefox window. Firefox inoisa add-ons iyo yakanyorwa; ona README yekunyora kopi yako.";
"Install the ndm command, then for example: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night" = "Kuisa ndm command, uyezve, semuenzaniso: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night";
"Finding the qualities on offer…" = "Kuwana zvinhu zvinopihwa…";
"Video sites are saved in the best quality available, with picture and sound joined." = "Video masaiti anochengetwa mumhando yepamusoro, nechifananidzo uye mashoko akabatanidzwa.";
"Put a range in square brackets: [001-100] keeps three digits, [1-100] does not, [a-z] uses letters and [0-100:5] counts in fives. Several ranges multiply." = "Sarudza pakati pezvikwangwani: [001-100] inochengeta madhigirii matatu, [1-100] haina, [a-z] inoshandisa mazita uye [0-100:5] ino counts in fives.";
